From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Borodin <hatemosphere@protonmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 11:40:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(engine): don't panic in Map/Set iterator lock finalizers

Port of https://github.com/boa-dev/boa/pull/5674.

Adapted to boa 0.22, which lacks upstream #5528 (iterator indices kept across clear()): clear() here is not lock-aware, so its hunk has nothing to change and the iterator_across_delete_and_clear test, which relies on #5528, is left out.
